00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:49.080
When a car is coming you must stand by the road to be sure the driver can see you,

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:52.400
Once the driver can see you, zoom in and place the..."eye" icon on the car.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:55.120
Once the "eye" icon turns fully white, it will enter hitch mode.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:57.840
Here you must press the space key once the "eye" icon turns green.

