00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:24.380
Looking left will prevent them from attacking you?

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:27.060
Every time you look at the stranger it will fill the "Sketch Meter" a bit.

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:30.500
